{"overview":"بلاروس، نزدیک مرز لهستان، سال 1943. پسر نوجوانی به نام «فلوریا» (کرافچنکو) تفنگی را از زیر خاک بیرون می‌آورد تا به پارتیزان‌هایی که، به رهبری «کوساچ»، در جنگل مخفی شده‌اند، بپیوندد. نیروهای نازی به منطقه یورش می‌برند و پارتیزان‌ها عقب می‌کشند تا خود را برای یک ضد حمله آماده می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The invasion of a village in Belarus by German forces sends young Flyora into the forest to join the weary Resistance fighters, against his family's wishes. There he meets a girl, Glasha, who accompanies him back to his village. On returning home, Flyora finds his family and fellow peasants massacred. His continued survival amidst the brutal debris of war becomes increasingly nightmarish, a battle between despair and hope.","tagline_en":"The cruelest side of war.","runtime":142,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Элем Климов"],"crew_en":["Elem Klimov"],"countries":["SU"],"cast":[{"name":"Алексей Кравченко","role":"Flyora Gayshun","photo":"/o7UD6o30iJ29dTHPCbtOScv9s5E.jpg","en":"Aleksei Kravchenko"},{"name":"Ольга Миронова","role":"Glasha","photo":"/l4H4wR7B1NiY48uif6PITGB4T6.jpg","en":"Olga Mironova"},{"name":"Liubomiras Laucevičius","role":"Kosach","photo":"/r6Gdi2P7D6cPHcgTvvO4NSzvb9I.jpg"},{"name":"Vladas Bagdonas","role":"Rubezh","photo":"/58chkP7aSp51iKDjEtP295ZWl6k.jpg"},{"name":"Jüri Lumiste","role":"Obersturmführer","photo":"/wU5CyMxiwzEU5mCSSUsTZeIHp8A.jpg"},{"name":"Viktors Lorencs","role":"Sturmbannführer","photo":"/24LC3IfTgkY7Mj7fjQENx6Q9oaf.jpg"},{"name":"Kazimir Rabetsky","role":"Village Headman","photo":"/qQzj2XqMqf4OpFwBFYGR5lRETtY.jpg"},{"name":"Евгений Тиличеев","role":"Gezhel","photo":"/1je1iVIpiAvJ0CAt4KDk6ALe434.jpg","en":"Yevgeni Tilicheyev"},{"name":"Александр Берда","role":"Chief of Staff of the Partisan Detachment","photo":"/rUldJxRhCDRhlYegoaTK6U4fl2H.jpg","en":"Aleksandr Berda"},{"name":"Г. Вельц","role":"Medical NCO","photo":"","en":"G. Velts"},{"name":"Виктор Васильев","role":"German","photo":"/